<div id="shop">
  <section class="intro">
    <%= image_tag "shop-title.svg", alt: "Shop so you don't drop", class: "shop-title" %>
  </section>
  <section class="belly">
    <div class="row m-0">
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 belly-height belly-left">
        <div class="belly-text">
          <h2 class="mb-0">from my</h2>
          <h2 class="mb-0">happy <span class="blue">belly</span></h2>
          <h2 class="last">to yours.</h2>
          <p class="blue mb-0">Pure, vegan, and homemade goodies.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 belly-height belly-right">
        <p>In 2020 I had some friends over for brunch and decided to whip up a meal made entirely from scratch - from the sweet potato fatbread to the almond butter. I spent an entire morning preparing.</p>
        <p>My almond butter was a hit! After some prompting and motivation from loved ones, I started making and selling almond butter while studying for my Health Coaching certifcate. What started as a side project eventually evolved into a small business with a limited product range of almond butter, peanut butter, and granolas. The ingredients I use are pure, vegan, and without preservatives.  (& many satisfed customers!) can guarantee delicious taste and great quality yummies jam-packed with nutrients.  </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="support-section">
    <h2 class="mb-0 support-text">If you want to support Sunchef’s food products </h2>
    <h2 class="support-text">and make your belly happy, here is where you can fnd me: </h2>
    <p class="support-subtext">(In Lebanon only… for now!)</p>
    <p class="mb-0 locations">Mint Basil Market | Liv Good | Emak Urban Spa | A New Earth Store | amat Beirut</p>
    <p class="mb-0 locations">Convivio | Le Panier du Coin | Tusk Bakery | Fine Bouche | La Vie Claire | en Fraicheur</p>
    <p class="mb-0 locations">Chi Tabi3i | Akiki Frere | eir el Oumara</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <div class="carousel" data-controller="carousel" data-carousel-element-class="carousel">
      <% 10.times do %>
        <div class="carousel-slide">
          <%= image_tag "risotto.jpeg", alt: "carousel" %>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
